sDMFp5fu6K20vGfLjlMK4OXw=="}, {"id": "msg_056eb743404369fb016ad547c2dd4c87d1a19f55ffe9c98785", "content": [{"annotations": [], "text": "{\"statements\":[\"NVIDIA's FY2026 10-K says acquisitions and investments involve significant challenges and risks.\",\"Acquisitions and investments could impair NVIDIA's ability to grow NVIDIA's business, develop new products, or sell NVIDIA's products.\",\"Acquisitions and investments could ultimately hurt NVIDIA's financial results.\",\"Pursuing a particular transaction could limit NVIDIA's ability to enter into other transactions that could help NVIDIA achieve other strategic objectives.\",\"Delays in completing acquisitions, including delays caused by regulatory approvals, could prevent NVIDIA from pursuing other transactions.\",\"Delays in completing acquisitions could prevent NVIDIA from retaining critical talent from a target company.\",\"Technology could evolve before an acquisition closes, making the acquisition less attractive.\",\"Regulators could impose conditions that reduce the ultimate value of acquisitions.\",\"Investments in companies could create volatility and fluctuations in NVIDIA's results, including realized gains or losses and unrealized gains or losses.\",\"NVIDIA could lose up to the full value of an investment.\",\"Numerous investee companies may not achieve profitability in the near term or at any time.\",\"NVIDIA has no guarantee of a return on investments.\",\"Investments in private companies include investments in early-stage companies still defining strategic direction.\",\"Many securities from private company investments are non-marketable and illiquid at the time of initial investment.\",\"Unsuccessful investee companies could cause NVIDIA to recognize an impairment or lose all or part of an investment.\",\"NVIDIA's investment portfolio contains industry sector concentration risks.\",\"A decline in one or more industry sectors could increase impairment losses.\",\"Acquisitions and strategic investments could divert capital and management attention.\",\"Acquisitions and strategic investments could make a satisfactory return difficult to realize.\",\"Acquisitions and strategic investments could create difficulty obtaining governmental or regulatory approvals or financing.\",\"Acquisitions and strategic investments could lead to legal proceedings.\",\"Due diligence could fail to identify significant issues related to an acquisition or investment.\",\"Acquisitions could create difficulty integrating technology, systems, operations, and key personnel.\",\"Acquisitions could require NVIDIA to assume liabilities.\",\"Acquisitions could result in amortization expenses, goodwill impairment charges, or write-downs of acquired assets.\",\"Acquisitions could create difficulty integrating accounting, forecasting, and controls.\",\"Acquisitions could affect NVIDIA's stock price.\",\"Failure to obtain regulatory approval or close an acquisition could result in fines, fees, or reputational harm.\",\"Debt financing for acquisitions could increase debt and interest expense and create difficulty complying with debt covenants.\",\"Acquisitions could involve dilutive equity issuances.\",\"Acquisitions could involve variability in performance-based consideration.\",\"Negative changes in economic conditions could affect acquisitions.\",\"Acquisitions could create additional cybersecurity risks.\",\"Acquisitions could impair relationships with employees, vendors, and customers.\",\"NVIDIA has experienced challenges integrating acquisition target systems.\",\"NVIDIA has experienced lengthy and costly systems integration and delays in purchasing and shipping products.\",\"Systems integration challenges and purchasing and shipping delays have affected NVIDIA's results of operations and may continue to affect NVIDIA's results of operations.\",\"NVIDIA's FY2026 10-K says NVIDIA is finalizing an investment and partnership agreement with OpenAI.\",\"NVIDIA's FY2026 10-K provides no assurance that NVIDIA will enter into an investment and partnership agreement with OpenAI or complete a transaction.\",\"In fiscal year 2026, NVIDIA invested $26.2 billion in private companies and infrastructure funds, primarily in early-stage startups.\",\"NVIDIA's fiscal year 2026 investments included AI model makers purchasing NVIDIA products.\",\"Many fiscal year 2026 investments in private companies and infrastructure funds are illiquid and non-marketable.\",\"In fiscal year 2026, NVIDIA provided $3.5 billion in land, power, and shell guarantees to early-stage companies.\",\"Escrow and partners' operating activities may be insufficient to cover a default under the guarantees.\",\"If escrow and partners' operating activities are insufficient to cover a default, NVIDIA may assume the underlying leases or sublease the underlying leases.\"]}", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message", "phase": "final_answer"}], "parallel_tool_calls": true, "temperature": 1.0, "tool_choice": "auto", "tools": [], "top_p": 0.98, "background": false, "completed_at": 1792362439.0, "max_output_tokens": 10000, "max_tool_calls": null, "moderation": null, "previous_response_id": null, "prompt_cache_key": null, "prompt_cache_retention": "24h", "reasoning": {"context": "all_turns", "effort": "medium", "mode": "standard", "summary": null}, "safety_identifier": null, "service_tier": "default", "status": "completed", "text": {"format": {"name": "StatementGeneratorOutput", "schema": {"description": "Structured output for statement generation.", "properties": {"statements": {"description": "The generated statements from the answer", "items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Statements", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["statements"], "title": "StatementGeneratorOutput", "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false}, "type": "json_schema", "description": null, "strict": true}, "verbosity": "medium"}, "top_logprobs": 0, "truncation": "disabled", 